      "points_per_level": 50,
      "can_level": true,
      "levels": 19,
      "local_notes": "**Compartmentalized Mind 19**, base **[950]**:\n\n| Modifier | Value |\n|---|---:|\n| Massively Parallel | +20% |\n| Cosmic — Power cannot be Negated | +50% |\n| Switchable | +10% |\n| Reduced Fatigue Cost 1 | +20% |\n| **Total enhancements** | **+100%** |\n\n**Cost:** 950 × 2 = **[1,900]**.\n\nThere are **19 additional normal compartments, 20 total**. The discussed expanded benchmark is **approximately 5,000 noncombat threads**. The earlier CM 20 alternative meant 21 normal compartments and approximately 7,000 expanded threads.\n\nThe expansion serves cognition, administration, conversation, simulation, and attention. It does not multiply physical combat maneuvers or automatically turn parallel remembered activity into skill training. Reduced Fatigue Cost 1 removes the discussed 1 FP activation cost; no continuing FP upkeep was specified.\n\nEarlier estimates of 50 normal threads for Tsar and 250 for Sol were capacity discussions, not extra purchases silently added to this build.",
      "calc": {
        "points": 1900,
        "current_level": 19
      }
    },
