      "base_points": 5,
      "local_notes": "**Photographic/Eidetic Memory [10]** with **Cosmic — Total Experiential Archive +150%**.\n\n**Cost:** 10 × 2.50 = **[25]**.\n\nThe intended Archive retains the full streams, their sources, synchronization, bodily perspectives, and nested context without confusing one participant's experience with another's. It is separate from Familiar Bond and does not make fictitious experience a historical event.",
      "calc": {
        "points": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "TGRkWZpuHNEqQ9_Zg",
      "name": "Familiar Bond",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "tnJ4bMRelA-y4sZ6j",
          "name": "Familiar Bond Channel",
          "local_notes": "A Familiar Bond establishes a standing Mindlink. Tsargoth may open a telepathic channel to that familiar; Mindlink makes this contact automatic. Once opened, the channel may remain established indefinitely regardless of distance or world. While open, Familiar Consciousness is Always On and the familiar's complete conscious stream flows continuously into Tsargoth. Tsargoth cannot selectively suppress or filter incoming information while leaving that channel open. He may deliberately close the entire channel as a free action, stopping conscious-stream reception until he reopens it. Closing the channel does not sever the underlying Mindlink.",
          "calc": {
            "points": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tXLSq5A7AUkBQLzDi",
          "name": "Me-Stream",
          "local_notes": "Tsargoth may combine Familiar Communion with Mindscape to deliberately share any selected portion of his current conscious experience as an immersive first-person perspective. This may include thoughts, emotions, sensory experience, body-schema, proprioception, interoception, remembered experience, and selected conscious streams currently present within his awareness. Mindscape provides the experiential representation; Familiar Communion carries Tsargoth's genuine live conscious state.",
          "calc": {
            "points": 0
          }
        },
