              "base_points": 25,
              "local_notes": "Base **Illusion [25]**:\n\n| Modifier | Value |\n|---|---:|\n| Mental | +100% |\n| Initiative | +100% |\n| Stigmata | +100% |\n| Cosmic — Irresistible Attack | +300% |\n| Cosmic — No Rule of 16 | +50% |\n| Cosmic — No Multiple-Subject Penalty | +50% |\n| Cosmic — Safe Compressed Experience | +100% |\n| Cosmic — Source-Authentic Sensorium | +100% |\n| Cosmic — Can Heal as Well as Harm | +50% |\n| Reliable 10 | +50% |\n| Cosmic — No Ordinary LOS Requirement for Valid Bond Subjects | +50% |\n| Reduced Time 1 | +20% |\n| Cosmic — Cross-Reality / World-Spanning Targeting | +100% |\n| **Total enhancements** | **+1,170%** |\n\n**Cost:** 25 × 12.70 = 317.5 → **[318]**.\n\nThe Cosmic descriptions above are campaign-specific extensions. This mental ability is self-contained; it does not gain an external physical TK body just by being used.\n\n**Established September 20 interpretation:**\n\n- A participant can experience a coherent embodied environment, including a different perceived form or sensory capacities their physical body lacks.\n- Initiative permits responsive simulation. Bond feedback allows separate participants' experiences to remain synchronized.\n- Tsar may participate with his own actual consciousness; self-inclusion does not create a duplicate person.\n- Physical input and Mindscape input can coexist and be selectively mapped to bodily responses.\n- The established Cosmic/Stigmata version can produce real bodily responses and the discussed healing effects. The earlier assertion that it could only cause injury was superseded.\n- This is not an automatic Affliction (Ecstasy) effect.\n- A mental experience does not transfer a physical biological agent, cause conception through that agent, or accumulate Divine Union doses.\n\n**Earlier sensory modifiers:** The former [290] Mental Illusion used separate Extended senses. Memory-Perfect Reconstruction +50% was also proposed during development, but it is not a separate enabled enhancement in the recovered [318] stack. Do not add it to that price without rebuilding the ability.",
              "calc": {
                "points": 318
              }
            }
          ],
          "local_notes": "Mindscape Illusion [318], included once in Familiar Bond. External physical force is supplied separately by Illusory Environment.",
          "calc": {
            "points": 318
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tsqRpkKAd01bsIW-3",
          "name": "Shared Mindscape Self-Inclusion",
          "tags": [
            "Feature",
            "Sol Mahina"
          ],
          "local_notes": "Included operating feature [0] of already purchased abilities; no independent free power.\n\nTsar participates with his actual consciousness; this does not create a duplicate person.",
          "calc": {
            "points": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tHLSl1cIiiDq0MsMG",
          "name": "Concurrent Somatic Mapping",
          "tags": [
            "Feature",
            "Sol Mahina"
          ],
          "local_notes": "Included operating feature [0] of already purchased abilities; no independent free power.\n\nIndependent mental and physical sources can affect one real physiological state; retain source identity. No physical biological agent transfers through simulation.",
          "calc": {
            "points": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "t5si4jxMQtm6N5trk",
          "name": "Recursive Perspective Integrity",
          "tags": [
            "Feature",
            "Sol Mahina"
          ],
          "local_notes": "Included operating feature [0] of already purchased abilities; no independent free power.\n\nNested experience does not multiply one event into an infinite feedback loop. Count independent inputs separately, not repeated views of the same input.",
          "calc": {
            "points": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tB-m9qSSaskPPrh_k",
          "name": "Experiential Training Integrity",
          "tags": [
            "Feature",
            "Sol Mahina"
          ],
          "local_notes": "Included operating feature [0] of already purchased abilities; no independent free power.\n\nGenuine practice may count under the campaign training rules. Inserted memory or extra noncombat threads do not independently prove training occurred.",
          "calc": {
            "points": 0
          }
        }
      ],
      "container_type": "meta_trait",
      "local_notes": "Current supplied modifier build, with Multiplicative Modifiers: [1,481], including Mindscape [318] once. The separately purchased Archive [25] brings this to [1,506].\n\nCOST REVIEW: the earlier notes recorded [1,454], using Familiar Consciousness [177]. This upload supplies the complete actual modifier list: enhancements +870%, Telecommunication −20%, Always On −10%. That is 30 × 9.70 × 0.70 = 203.7 → [204], not [177]. The earlier 30 × 9.80 × 0.60 formula would require different enhancement and limitation totals. No artificial remainder or replacement modifier has been inserted to force the old figure.\n\n- The incoming familiar-to-Tsar stream rides the standing Telecommunication/Mindlink connection.\n- While that channel is open, reception is **Always On and complete**. Tsar does not selectively redact parts of that incoming conscious stream.\n- Tsar may close the whole incoming channel as a free action without severing Mindlink.\n- Outbound thoughts, feelings, memories, and sensations are deliberately sent through Telesend.\n- No extra Accessibility limitation was adopted just to describe this channel architecture.\n- Severing the bond and closing a stream are different operations.\n- Receiving a complete current conscious stream is distinct from actively probing memories.\n- A bestowed bond interface can connect a familiar without requiring them to purchase Tsar's full telepathic suite.\n\nAn earlier **Bestow Familiar Bond [59]** Affliction was proposed. Its complete final delivery build was not recovered, and it is not silently included in the [1,454] receiver/communication suite.",
      "tags": [
        "Needs Review",
        "Telepathy"
      ],
      "calc": {
        "points": 1481
      }
    },
