          "points_per_level": 5,
          "can_level": true,
          "levels": 30,
          "local_notes": "Base **5 × 30 = [150]**:\n\n| Modifier | Value |\n|---|---:|\n| Area Effect 22 | +1,100% |\n| Super-Effort | +400% |\n| Cosmic — Power cannot be Negated | +50% |\n| Independence | +40% |\n| Link | +10% |\n| Selective Area | +20% |\n| Reduced Fatigue Cost 1 | +20% |\n| **Total enhancements** | **+1,640%** |\n\n**Cost:** 150 × 17.40 = **[2,610]**.\n\n**Radius printed on the supplied sheet:** **4,194,304 yards**, approximately **2,383.13 miles**.\n\nThe purchased TK level is now **30**. Area Effect sets its coverage separately from that strength. Super-Effort remains enabled at +400%; its strength calculation must use the new level rather than the former TK 23 benchmark. A projected individual does not automatically receive a separate full-strength TK purchase.\n\nRanged appears on the Illusion component; it is not listed on the screenshot's TK component and is not included in [2,610].",
          "calc": {
            "points": 2610,
            "current_level": 30
          }
