          "local_notes": "Base **Illusion [25]**:\n\n| Modifier | Value |\n|---|---:|\n| Initiative | +100% |\n| Area Effect 21 | +1,050% |\n| Ranged | +40% |\n| Selective Area | +20% |\n| Link — Illusory Environment | +10% |\n| Cosmic — Irresistible | +300% |\n| Cosmic — Source-Authentic Sensorium | +100% |\n| **Total enhancements** | **+1,620%** |\n\n**Cost:** 25 × 17.20 = **[430]**.\n\n**Radius printed on the supplied sheet:** **2,097,152 yards**, approximately **1,191.56 miles**. See the radius-convention note below before interpreting that display as the final effective radius.\n\n**Initiative includes Independence** in this build. Source-Authentic Sensorium supplies the full intended sensory qualities, including nonvisual and nonauditory senses. It replaces the earlier separately listed Extended Taste/Smell and Extended Touch enhancements.\n\nThe supplied **Illusory Environment I [250]** was an earlier Illusion-only design: Area Effect 13 +650%, Cosmic +50%, Extended Taste/Smell +20%, Extended Touch +20%, Initiative +100%, Ranged +40%, Selective Area +20%. Its arithmetic was correct for that older +900% stack, but it did not contain the later linked physical and perception suite.",
          "calc": {
            "points": 430
          }
        }
      ],
      "local_notes": "Settled screenshot package [3,305]: Telekinesis 30 [2,610], Clairsentience [265], and Illusion [430].\n\nThe screenshot displays **2^21 = 2,097,152 yards** for Illusion and **2^22 = 4,194,304 yards** for TK. Those labels are transcribed exactly above.\n\nThe earlier workbook used an **Illusion starting radius of two yards, doubled by each added Area Effect level**. Under that recorded convention, Illusion AE 21 gives **2 × 2^21 = 4,194,304 yards**, matching TK AE 22. The screenshot's generic-looking Illusion radius label does not show that extra starting factor.\n\nThe purchased levels, enhancement percentages, and [3,305] total are unambiguous. The remaining distinction is between the sheet's displayed radius and the previously recorded effective-area convention. **Keep Illusion AE 21 and TK AE 22 as supplied**; do not add another level merely to make the printed labels match.",
      "tags": [
        "External Projection",
        "Settled"
      ],
      "calc": {
        "points": 3305
      }
    },
