              "local_notes": "Base 5/level × Large Category 8 × 50 levels = 2,000 points before percentages. Permanent, structured creation; MM and per-trait rounding apply.\n\nEach component has **50 levels**, with the recorded Large Category base **5 × 8 = 40 points/level**; each therefore begins at **[2,000]** before percentage modifiers.\n\nShared modifier stack:\n\n| Modifier | Value |\n|---|---:|\n| Link | +20% |\n| Super-Effort | +400% |\n| Reduced Fatigue Cost 3 | +60% |\n| True Permanent | +100% |\n| Structured Creation | +100% |\n| Takes Recharge — 15 seconds | −20% |\n\n| Create category | Additional modifiers | MM cost |\n|---|---|---:|\n| Inorganic Matter | None | 2,000 × 7.80 × 0.80 = **[12,480]** |\n| Organic / Living Matter / Functional Minds | Living +50%; Functional Minds +70% | 2,000 × 9.00 × 0.80 = **[14,400]** |\n| Electromagnetic Energy | Full Energy Throughput +350%; Cosmic — No Normal Energy Ceiling +50% | 2,000 × 11.80 × 0.80 = **[18,880]** |\n| Dimensional Substrate | Dimensional Creation +100% | 2,000 × 8.80 × 0.80 = **[14,080]** |\n\n**Established permanence:** The September 13 choice was permanent created material, independent of Tsar and without a Creation Pool. Canceling or negating his ongoing ability does not erase material already created under this rule.\n\nStructured Creation supplies the designed organization of a creation. Living/Functional Minds covers the corresponding living and mental functions. Creating an already functional mind, awakening an existing subject, and investing divinity are separate concepts.\n\nThe old template's approximate output benchmarks were **1.13398 × 10¹⁸ kg of solids/liquids per use** and **2.5 × 10²³ J per energy use**. These are retained as working benchmarks; the recovered material did not supply a complete derivation for a fresh output audit.",
