      "container_type": "meta_trait",
      "local_notes": "Audited MM total [64,586]: Divine Create [59,840] + Realm Controls [4,746]. Time manipulation, Awakening and travel are separate. Permanent creations survive the end or negation of the ability; no Creation Pool.\n\nThe September 18 instruction was to **retain the large Genesis-created hoard interior despite correcting Time Control from 23 to 9**. A room's established dimensional interior does not shrink merely because the time-bubble purchase changes.\n\n**4,000 × 4,000 miles** was discussed as a candidate/size question. The earlier reply treated it as ample, but the recovered discussion did not verify a final dimensional specification. Preserve the large interior; do not label that exact dimension settled.\n\nThe settled level-23 Natural Phenomena Domain has a maximum **3,000-mile diameter**. The intermediate level-9 version had a 14-mile diameter; it is historical.\n\nThe September 18 hoard estimate used **TL6 starting wealth $10,000**, **Multimillionaire 12 → $1 quintillion**, and **Independent Income 20 → $200 quadrillion/month**. Treat these as recorded working wealth assumptions. Applying a 100:1 calendar conversion to income, and converting monetary value into a physical treasure volume, were illustrative proposals rather than established automatic multipliers.",
      "calc": {
        "points": 64586
      }
    },
