      "local_notes": "**Status:** Accepted rename and conceptual scope; recovered build with corrected MM cost.  \n**Former name:** Divine Gift of Sapience.  \n**Cost:** **[1,083]**, replacing the old additive **[4,255]**.\n\n**Affliction 10**, base **[100]**, carrying a **[250] payload**:\n\n- **IQ +6 [120]**.\n- **Language [6]**.\n- **Soul [0]**, as a setting feature.\n- Up to **124 points** removing the applicable animalistic or restrictive traits identified by the build.\n\nExamples of traits considered for removal included Bestial, Cannot Speak/Mute, No Fine Manipulators, Slave Mentality, and other body/template limitations. The actual changes must match the subject; this is a stated payload budget, not an instruction to remove traits the subject does not possess.\n\n| Modifier | Value |\n|---|---:|\n| Grants [250] payload | +2,500% |\n| Cancellation | +10% |\n| Area Effect 14 | +700% |\n| Permanent Duration | +300% |\n| Selective Area | +20% |\n| Cosmic — Divine / True Awakening | +300% |\n| Cumulative | +400% |\n| Backlash — −1 IQ / Stunning | −20% |\n| Costs Fatigue 5 | −25% |\n| Preparation Required | −30% |\n\n**Cost:** 100 × 43.30 × 0.25 = 1,082.5 → **[1,083]**.\n\n**Established interpretation:**\n\n- IQ +6 is an **increase**, not “set IQ to 6”: IQ 4 becomes 10, IQ 10 becomes 16.\n- The Cosmic +300% choice addresses the intended awakening of otherwise unsuitable or immense targets, including Sol's realm-body; it replaced the idea of merely raising Affliction to 50.\n- First awakening establishes personhood and a soul where appropriate. Repeated elevation does not create duplicate souls.\n- Functional Minds already created through Genesis need not first be treated as nonsapient.\n- The resulting person is independent. Tsar retains Cancellation of his own gift under the accepted construction, even though he would virtually never use it.\n- This is separate from bestowing Divine Spark.",
      "reference": "B35,P39",
      "source": {
        "library": "richardwilkes/gcs_master_library",
        "path": "Basic Set/Basic Set Traits.adq",
        "id": "t9fwzDbdQy1S9CHUx"
      },
      "calc": {
        "points": 1083,
        "current_level": 10
      }
    },
