              "id": "mOipmNf6toXl-145t",
              "name": "Cosmic",
              "cost_adj": "50%",
              "local_notes": "Temporal Bandwidth"
            }
          ],
          "reference": "B52",
          "disabled": true,
          "local_notes": "INCOMPLETE OR PROPOSED BUILD. Disabled deliberately. A displayed zero is not a free power; finalize the specification and price before use.\n\n**Enhanced Time Sense [45]** with **Cosmic — Temporal Bandwidth +50%**:\n\n**45 × 1.50 = 67.5 → [68].**\n\nThe September 20 proposal lets the interface comprehend and synchronize mental/sensory streams across the **100:1** Sol Mahina time mismatch. It does not buy 100 levels of anything and does not increase physical speed.\n\nThis is distinct from Mindscape's Safe Compressed Experience and from genuine local time manipulation. The intended function was discussed; the exact +50% valuation and any capacity beyond 100:1 remain a working proposal.",
          "calc": {
            "points": 0
