          "local_notes": "INCOMPLETE OR PROPOSED BUILD. Disabled deliberately. A displayed zero is not a free power; finalize the specification and price before use.\n\n**Status:** Accepted template-access concept; variable-cost working recipe.  \n**Sources:** September 13–14.\n\nUse **Affliction → Advantage: Alternate Form**, with the replacement racial template determining the payload cost.\n\nThe discussed recipe includes:\n\n- Always On for the imposed Alternate Form/template.\n- **Once On, Stays On +50%**.\n- **Permanent +150%**.\n- **Cancellation +10%**.\n- **Cosmic — Protected Transformation +50%**.\n- Optional **Native Rewrite +100%** only if the intended result is a true rewrite of native biology.\n\nThe older racial template remains inaccessible while the imposed form is in force; a separate ancestry-removal purchase was not required in the accepted concept. Canceling the Affliction can restore access to the original template.\n\nThe exact placement of payload modifiers and the resulting price depend on the chosen Alternate Form. A **[0] recipe entry is not a free purchased transformation power**.",
