          "local_notes": "INCOMPLETE OR PROPOSED BUILD. Disabled deliberately. A displayed zero is not a free power; finalize the specification and price before use.\n\nSelena's discussed build included **Always**, **Summonable**, **Special Abilities**, and **Minion**. The recorded alternatives were:\n\n| Selena's relative point value | Recorded Ally cost |\n|---|---:|\n| 50% | **[24]** |\n| 75% | **[36]** |\n\nThe 50% versus 75% choice remained open. Minion was accepted as reflecting Selena's nature, not mistreatment.\n\nLater discussion recognized that Tsar's existing bond and Jumper/Tunnel can arrange willing family members' arrival. **Do not automatically apply Summonable to every family Ally** solely because an early pass did so.\n\nRelative-scale notes also changed during the discussion: Freya moved from an early 75% estimate to approximately **90–100%**; Embyr was discussed as approximately Tsar's power; Artemis and Seliniea as **100–150%**. These are planning estimates, not fully purchased entries. An overall Allies budget around **2,000 points**, within an approximate **1,000–3,000** range, was a placeholder.",
