          "local_notes": "INCOMPLETE OR PROPOSED BUILD. Disabled deliberately. A displayed zero is not a free power; finalize the specification and price before use.\n\n**Status:** Recovered working package and consent rule; internal contact-cost discrepancy retained.  \n**Recorded total:** **[479]**.\n\n| Component | Cost | Purpose |\n|---|---:|---|\n| Divine Rebirth | **[113]** | Restores a consenting deceased subject. |\n| Whisper Beyond the Veil | **[366]** | Contacts the deceased to ask whether they want return and/or sanctuary. |\n\n### Divine Rebirth [113]\n\n**Affliction 1 [10]**:\n\n| Modifier | Value |\n|---|---:|\n| Grants Extra Life 1 | +250% |\n| Area Effect 5 | +250% |\n| Cancellation | +10% |\n| Cosmic — Can Affect the Dead | +100% |\n| Malediction | +100% |\n| Permanent Duration | +300% |\n| Selective Area | +20% |\n\n**Cost:** 10 × 11.30 = **[113]**.\n\nThe established intent requires a **consenting deceased soul**. Permanent and Cancellation are present in the recorded construction; Cumulative is not part of this recovered Rebirth stack.\n\n### Whisper Beyond the Veil [366]\n\nThe contact suite combines **Telesend and Mind Reading**, with dead-target access, the discussed disregard of ordinary distance, Area Effect 5, Selective Area, Link, and rapid contact.\n\nCosmic barriers, imprisonment of the soul, or destruction can still prevent contact under the recorded interpretation.\n\nThe older breakdowns disagree over **Mind Reading [186] versus [188]**, while Telesend was recorded as **[180]**. The detailed export also contains Link entries at more than one level. Keep the **[366] package figure** as recorded; the original modifier application needs reconciliation before claiming one fully verified internal split.",
